  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Applied research in South Africa, 2010-2013       Partner Driven Cooperation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Till&#xe4;mpad forskning, akt&#xf6;rssamverkan i Sydafrika  2010-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till till&#xe4;mnpad forskning genom akt&#xf6;rsssamverkan. Bidraget omfattar sju projekt (begr&#xe4;nsat
bidrag) inom till&#xe4;mpad forskning, som beviljades i en utlysning 2010. Avtalsparterna
har varit svenska l&#xe4;ros&#xe4;ten som samarbetat med partners i Sydafrika inom ramen f&#xf6;r Partner Driven
Samarbete (PDC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to applied research through partner driven cooperation. The contribution includes seven projects (limited
contributions) within applied research, which were granted in a call for proposals in 2010. The agreement partners
have been Swedish universities who cooperated with partners in South Africa within the framework of Partner Driven
Cooperation (PDC).</narrative>
  </description>
